D101/D102 helper routines (ffdd_on, ffdd_consts, ffdd_fname, ffdd_in, ffdd_stage, ffdd_out, ffdd_ke, ffdd_te, ffdd_eadd; units 1120-1125). Generated by diff -u against the PRISTINE ATM_DRV.f (2026-10-05); inserted after 'end subroutine daily_atm' (unchanged code), so it applies to the pristine file or after other ATM_DRV.f patches. Uses only existing modules (model_com, constant, resolution, geom, dynamics, atm_com, somtq_com, fluxes). The helper reads FFD_START/FFD_NSTEP itself.

--- ATM_DRV.f.orig
